rewrite-app/docs/ORIGINAL-SESSION.md:245:The Source-only checks establish an immutable command oracle. Native group-monitor authentication is implemented in the later section below; command producer/consumer/ACK adapters remain open. Monitor identity must not be fabricated as a default participant execution mode or automatically promoted to an administrator. No broad functional or visual row closes.
